    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "HWP Estate Agents are delighted to bring to the market this superb three-bedroom end-of-terrace home at 21 Hunters Lane, located in the highly sought-after Hunterswood development. This property comes to the market in immaculate condition only recently been refurbished. This property is ideal for first-time buyers, growing families, and investors.\n No. 21 is laid out over three floors, comprising three generously sized bedrooms, three bathrooms, and an additional attic room, which can be ideal for a home office. Upon entrance, you are met with a welcoming hallway and WC, a modern kitchen and a spacious living area filled with natural daylight. \nThe property has a large back garden with side entrance off-street parking, along with a huge amount of amenities right on your doorstep, including Firhouse Shopping Centre, Woodstown Shopping Centre, Lidl, Tesco, and primary and secondary schools.\nThe property is conveniently located 10 minutes from the M50, with local public transport, including the No.15 bus route just outside the estate. \nViewing is highly recommended as this property won't be on the market for long.\n\nOutside \nOff street parking"
      },
